She looks very. very. very. very young.

216
00:10:23.539 --> 00:10:25.166
Sorry. I am so sorry.

217
00:10:25.249 --> 00:10:28.669
Oh. my gosh. No. No worries.
It's totally fine. Don't sweat it.

218
